  "Genres": "Action",
  "Name": "Fantastic Fivesome",
  "Overview": "After a visit to the doctor, the player is presented with a devastating diagnosis: death in one week! The only cure is having a fivesome with four beautiful women.\n\nThe Fantastic Fivesome is a choose-your-own adventure game. During each scene, the player interacts with one of the four potential fivesome partners. The only available interaction is choosing one of three dialogue options. Depending on the choices, the player either wins the scene (consequence: starting the next scene) or loses (consequence: trying the scene again).",
